   1  *************************************************************
   2  * Scenario Testing FBA for Lysine Enhancement
   3  * Tests the impact of gene knockouts, overexpression, and
   4  * o2-bound mimicry on lysine production in WT models
   5  *************************************************************
   6  * Run this from each Wild_Type/B{DAP}/ directory
   7  *************************************************************
   9   
  10  OPTIONS
  11          decimals = 8
  12          lp = cplex
  13          limrow = 0
  14          limcol = 0
  15          solprint = off
  16          sysout = off
  17  ;
  18   
  19  *********Defining Sets**************************************
  20  SETS
  21          i                       set of metabolites
INCLUDE    /mnt/nrdstor/ssbio/nampimah/ENDOSPERM/2026/Endosperm_Model_MARY/Wild_Type/B6/metabolites.txt
